      "updated": 1790170801957,
      "link": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1310.4546#page=2",
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "This grounds on an \nimportant property of word embeddings: word embeddings\nposses an inherit compositionality such that:\nking - man + woman = queen  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis suggest that using basic mathematical operations is possible\nto  creates new dense representation\nthat inherits characteristics from its addends.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
