    {
      "id": "8JMtQ5tB69ugpPkx8TZMm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8659.784896118708,
      "y": 1400.7650203571102,
      "width": 926.7504882812497,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "LVPGHVTx_AGX5tYsFC9Ku",
        "HKriuhEJ6rrB8UUOrGMwN",
        "GkWcylcHYkY4__67s-h9t"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 59430236,
      "version": 5097,
      "versionNonce": 241871068,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790169211893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DSM contains three components: \n    (i) an auto-regressive backbone,\n    (ii) an input embedder for X and Y into the backbone, and \n    (iii) a sampler for Ỹτ conditioned on the output of the backbone.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRepresentations\nGiven a wavefor we turn it into a more compact latent space using the Mimi codec. \n\nFor text, we tokenize text using a vocabulary specifically trained on speech data\ntranscriptions. Two tokens have a special meaning: \n    - PAD (indicating the absence of words at this time) and \n    - WORD (indicating the start of a new word)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DSM contains three components: \n    (i) an auto-regressive backbone,\n    (ii) an input embedder for X and Y into the backbone, and \n    (iii) a sampler for Ỹτ conditioned on the output of the backbone.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRepresentations\nGiven a wavefor we turn it into a more compact latent space using the Mimi codec. \n\nFor text, we tokenize text using a vocabulary specifically trained on speech data transcriptions. Two tokens have a special meaning: \n    - PAD (indicating the absence of words at this time) and \n    - WORD (indicating the start of a new word)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1790149669589,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
