        "0zYsa48pgaVj0TueKThuA",
        "uw6V1-EujycPjDY6qUwB1",
        "02nOUPF6frs7LPsGIxYzZ",
        "03FVg9wmSkb2Qo10lAWRx",
        "UXONg1J5ODWwQj1xOjo5K"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bEV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 879752924,
      "version": 5402,
      "versionNonce": 1649498460,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "nhadzUNp92uoD4HyplKf5",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1790169237766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“fixed delay” and “conditioned delay” describe two different\nways of training DSM-ASR with the delay  τ  between the\nincoming audio stream and the generated text stream.\n\n\nFixed delay\n\nWith fixed delay, the model is trained using one specific\nvalue of  τ. During training, the text stream is always\nshifted by 1.5 seconds relative to the audio stream. When\npredicting the text corresponding to time \\(t\\), I can rely\non roughly 1.5 seconds of future audio. If you then want a\nmodel optimized for 2.5 s instead, you would normally have\nto train another model\n\n\nConditioned delay\nInstead of always using one  τ , during training they\nrandomly sample different delays:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "“fixed delay” and “conditioned delay” describe two different ways of training DSM-ASR with the delay  τ  between the incoming audio stream and the generated text stream.\n\n\nFixed delay\n\nWith fixed delay, the model is trained using one specific value of  τ. During training, the text stream is always shifted by 1.5 seconds relative to the audio stream. When predicting the text corresponding to time \\(t\\), I can rely on roughly 1.5 seconds of future audio. If you then want a model optimized for 2.5 s instead, you would normally have to train another model\n\n\nConditioned delay\nInstead of always using one  τ , during training they randomly sample different delays:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1790151852912,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
